# ============================================================
# BREATHER DEGRADATION ANALYSIS
# ============================================================
#
# CORRECT METHODOLOGY
#
# Run_Number:
#     -> SHOP VISIT NUMBER
#     -> NOT breather replacement indicator
#
# Filtering:
#     -> Keep ESNs where MAX(Run_Number) == 1
#
# Breather replacement:
#     -> Determined using Breather/EGB Replacement Date
#
# Life normalization:
#     -> BASED ON ENGINE CYCLES
#     -> NOT calendar time
#
# Pipeline:
#
# Raw parameters
#       ↓
# Filter max Run_Number == 1
#       ↓
# Merge breather replacement date
#       ↓
# Split before/after breather replacement
#       ↓
# Sort by engine cycles
#       ↓
# Normalize life 0–100%
#       ↓
# EMA on 9 parameters
#       ↓
# Healthy region 20–60%
#       ↓
# ESN-specific healthy baseline
#       ↓
# Mahalanobis distance
#       ↓
# Healthy P50/P70/P80/P90/P95
#       ↓
# Step-function degradation state
#       ↓
# P95 persistence
#       ↓
# Graphs
#
# ============================================================


